&lt;h2&gt;


Workflow details
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;


01. 1.5x Upscale
&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Two ClownsharK Beta passes: 18 steps at CFG 4.5 (&lt;code&gt;er_sde&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;simple&lt;/code&gt;) then 34 steps at CFG 4.5; &lt;code&gt;LatentUpscaleBy&lt;/code&gt; between passes; Qwen-Image HDR VAE (&lt;code&gt;qwen_image_HDR_vae_fp32_comfy&lt;/code&gt;) and &lt;code&gt;qwen_3_06b_base&lt;/code&gt; text encoder.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Run it on RunningHub (invite code &lt;code&gt;rh-v1111&lt;/code&gt;): &lt;a href="https://www.runninghub.ai/post/2078374859184365569/?inviteCode=rh-v1111" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;https://www.runninghub.ai/post/2078374859184365569/?inviteCode=rh-v1111&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;


02. ControlNet Precision Control
&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;anima-base-202605-v1.0&lt;/code&gt; UNET with &lt;code&gt;anima-highres-aesthetic-boost&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;anima-turbo-lora-v0.2&lt;/code&gt;; &lt;code&gt;euler&lt;/code&gt; sampler, 30 steps, two passes with denoise 1.0 then 0.55; pose/depth/edge/line-art control branches in one graph.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Run it on RunningHub (invite code &lt;code&gt;rh-v1111&lt;/code&gt;): &lt;a href="https://www.runninghub.ai/post/2078701779059036161/?inviteCode=rh-v1111" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;https://www.runninghub.ai/post/2078701779059036161/?inviteCode=rh-v1111&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;


03. DMDX 4-Step Speed Run
&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;anima-base-202605-v1.0&lt;/code&gt; + &lt;code&gt;anima-turbo-lora-v0.2&lt;/code&gt; + &lt;code&gt;dmdx_student_final_comfy&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;ModelSamplingAuraFlow&lt;/code&gt;, 4 steps at CFG 1 with &lt;code&gt;er_sde&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Run it on RunningHub (invite code &lt;code&gt;rh-v1111&lt;/code&gt;): &lt;a href="https://www.runninghub.ai/post/2078701772113272834/?inviteCode=rh-v1111" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;https://www.runninghub.ai/post/2078701772113272834/?inviteCode=rh-v1111&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;


04. Three-Stage High-Quality Render
&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Three &lt;code&gt;KSampler&lt;/code&gt; stages with &lt;code&gt;LatentUpscaleBy&lt;/code&gt; between them: 34 steps at CFG 3, then 18 steps at CFG 1.8 with denoise 0.35.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Run it on RunningHub (invite code &lt;code&gt;rh-v1111&lt;/code&gt;): &lt;a href="https://www.runninghub.ai/post/2078374835163582465/?inviteCode=rh-v1111" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;https://www.runninghub.ai/post/2078374835163582465/?inviteCode=rh-v1111&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;


05. Tiled Upscale
&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;TTP_Image_Tile_Batch&lt;/code&gt; / &lt;code&gt;TTP_Image_Assemble&lt;/code&gt; tiling, &lt;code&gt;4x_NMKD-Siax_200k&lt;/code&gt; upscale model, &lt;code&gt;anima-base&lt;/code&gt; + turbo LoRA, plus a &lt;code&gt;Gundam_RX78_Flux&lt;/code&gt; LoRA at 0.85 in the sample graph; 20 steps at CFG 8.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Run it on RunningHub (invite code &lt;code&gt;rh-v1111&lt;/code&gt;): &lt;a href="https://www.runninghub.ai/post/2078701745957588993/?inviteCode=rh-v1111" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;https://www.runninghub.ai/post/2078701745957588993/?inviteCode=rh-v1111&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;


06. Image-to-Image + ControlNet + Face/Hand Repair
&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;waiANIMA_v10&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;anima-base&lt;/code&gt; UNETs, six &lt;code&gt;UltralyticsDetectorProvider&lt;/code&gt; nodes, four &lt;code&gt;FaceDetailer&lt;/code&gt; passes, &lt;code&gt;SAMLoader&lt;/code&gt;; 30 steps &lt;code&gt;euler&lt;/code&gt; at denoise 0.84.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Run it on RunningHub (invite code &lt;code&gt;rh-v1111&lt;/code&gt;): &lt;a href="https://www.runninghub.ai/post/2078701753071136769/?inviteCode=rh-v1111" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;https://www.runninghub.ai/post/2078701753071136769/?inviteCode=rh-v1111&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

