&lt;p&gt;&lt;code&gt;Qwen3VLProcessor&lt;/code&gt; captioning, &lt;code&gt;image_scale_pixel_v2&lt;/code&gt; resize, 31 steps &lt;code&gt;er_sde&lt;/code&gt; at denoise 0.7 with the turbo LoRA.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Run it on RunningHub (invite code &lt;code&gt;rh-v1111&lt;/code&gt;): &lt;a href="https://www.runninghub.ai/post/2078374866838974465/?inviteCode=rh-v1111" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;https://www.runninghub.ai/post/2078374866838974465/?inviteCode=rh-v1111&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

