&lt;p&gt;60 nodes: four &lt;code&gt;VAEDecode&lt;/code&gt;, four &lt;code&gt;FaceDetailer&lt;/code&gt; passes, two &lt;code&gt;LatentUpscaleBy&lt;/code&gt; stages, 30 steps &lt;code&gt;euler&lt;/code&gt; at CFG 3 then 2.88 with denoise 0.55.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Run it on RunningHub (invite code &lt;code&gt;rh-v1111&lt;/code&gt;): &lt;a href="https://www.runninghub.ai/post/2078701786382290946/?inviteCode=rh-v1111" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;https://www.runninghub.ai/post/2078701786382290946/?inviteCode=rh-v1111&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;


09. Text-to-Image Baseline
&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;p&gt;17 nodes: &lt;code&gt;UNETLoader&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;qwen_3_06b_base&lt;/code&gt; CLIP, Qwen-Image HDR VAE, turbo LoRA, 30 steps &lt;code&gt;er_sde&lt;/code&gt; at CFG 4.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Run it on RunningHub (invite code &lt;code&gt;rh-v1111&lt;/code&gt;): &lt;a href="https://www.runninghub.ai/post/2078701764664184833/?inviteCode=rh-v1111" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;https://www.runninghub.ai/post/2078701764664184833/?inviteCode=rh-v1111&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;


10. Anima-Edit LoRA and IC Method Tests
&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Three &lt;code&gt;KSampler&lt;/code&gt; passes at 20 steps &lt;code&gt;dpmpp_2m_sde_gpu&lt;/code&gt; CFG 5; &lt;code&gt;lora_edit_ZeroTwo&lt;/code&gt; and &lt;code&gt;AnimaEditV1&lt;/code&gt; LoRAs; &lt;code&gt;AddLabel&lt;/code&gt; nodes for side-by-side comparison.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Run it on RunningHub (invite code &lt;code&gt;rh-v1111&lt;/code&gt;): &lt;a href="https://www.runninghub.ai/post/2078374813801996290/?inviteCode=rh-v1111" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;https://www.runninghub.ai/post/2078374813801996290/?inviteCode=rh-v1111&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

