Promo and episode links
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;RunningHub with creator invite code &lt;code&gt;rh-v1111&lt;/code&gt;: &lt;a href="https://www.runninghub.ai/?inviteCode=rh-v1111" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;https://www.runninghub.ai/?inviteCode=rh-v1111&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creator workflow page: &lt;a href="https://www.runninghub.ai/user-center/1846601088051884033/webapp?inviteCode=rh-v1111" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;https://www.runninghub.ai/user-center/1846601088051884033/webapp?inviteCode=rh-v1111&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Video tutorial (YouTube): &lt;a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ShiAjBa8EXc" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ShiAjBa8EXc&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Chinese original (Bilibili): &lt;a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1xJKB6vEfp" rel="noopener noreferrer"&gt;https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1xJKB6vEfp&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
